            "lines": [
              "TEXT Basis: equity_filer_baseline -- common shares only, option legs excluded; one filer CIK counts once per ticker; a filer is classified (new / added / trimmed / exited / unchanged) only when it filed a <VAL> in this dataset for the previous quarter-end. Filers with shares but no previous-quarter filing are counted in no_baseline and in holders, never as buyers. shares_added / shares_removed / net_shares and value_* sum only classified filers; value = |share change| x the quarter-end close. Stock splits are adjusted using the holders' median share ratio; securities first held this quarter (new listings) are excluded from flow rankings. A filer whose traded value exceeds <VAL> the larger of its two reported holding values (share count and dollar value disagree) is left out of share and value flows; it is still counted as a holder. (flow_excluded_filers counts them.) comparability: comparable | split_adjusted (last quarter's shares x split_factor before classifying) | not_comparable (share and value flows are null) | first_reported (no filer held it last quarter). A null flow means unknown, never zero.",
              "BLANK",
              "H2 Institutional Activity — AAPL",
              "BLANK",
              "TEXT **Latest Quarter (<DATE>):**",
              "TEXT - Comparability: comparable",
              "TEXT - New positions: <VAL> | Added: <VAL> | Trimmed: <VAL> | Exited: <VAL> | Unchanged: <VAL>",
              "TEXT - No prior-quarter baseline (not classified): <VAL> | Holders: <VAL>",
              "TEXT - Net shares: <VAL> <VAL> | Net value: <MONEY>",
              "TEXT - Shares added: <VAL> | Shares removed: <VAL> | Value added: <MONEY> | Value removed: <MONEY>",
              "TEXT - Note -- legacy counts (all filers, including those without a prior-quarter baseline): Institutions increased (incl. new): <VAL> | Decreased (incl. exited): <VAL> | New: <VAL> | Exited: <VAL> | Net shares: <VAL> | Net value: <MONEY>",
              "BLANK",
              "H3 Quarterly Trend (equity_filer_baseline)",
              "BLANK",
              "THEAD Quarter | New | Added | Trimmed | Exited | Unchanged | No baseline | Holders | Net Shares | Net Value | Comparability",
              "TBODY",
              "BLANK",
              "TEXT *Note -- legacy counts (all filers, including those without a prior-quarter baseline; Increased includes New, Decreased includes Exited):*",
              "BLANK",
